{"ticker":"ISRG","updated":"2026-11-13T23:39:05Z","profile":{"longName":"Intuitive Surgical, Inc.","shortName":"Intuitive Surgical, Inc.","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Medical Instruments & Supplies","country":"United States","website":"https://www.intuitive.com","fullTimeEmployees":17021,"marketCap":153767690240,"trailingPE":53.63845,"forwardPE":35.576084,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":13.281023,"pegRatio":2.02,"targetMeanPrice":486.56668,"targetHighPrice":685.0,"targetLowPrice":324.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":30,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.217,"earningsGrowth":-0.236,"grossMargins":0.66642,"operatingMargins":0.31702,"profitMargins":0.25542,"totalRevenue":11578000384,"beta":1.439,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":603.88,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":328.57,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Intuitive Surgical, Inc. develops, manufactures, and markets products that enable physicians and healthcare providers to enhance the quality of and access to minimally invasive care in the United States and internationally. It offers the da Vinci Surgical System that enables surgical procedures using a minimally invasive approach; and Ion endoluminal system, which extends its commercial offerings beyond surgery into diagnostic endoluminal procedures enabling minimally invasive biopsies in the lung. The company also provides a suite of stapling, energy, and core instrumentation for its multi-port da Vinci surgical systems; progressive learning pathways to support the use of its technology; infrastructure of customer service and support specialists, a complement of services to its customers, including installation, repair, maintenance, 24/7 technical support, and proactive system health monitoring; and integrated digital capabilities providing connected offerings, streamlining performance for hospitals with program-enhancing insights. It sells its products through direct sales organizations, such as capital and clinical sales teams. Intuitive Surgical, Inc. was incorporated in 1995 and is headquartered in Sunnyvale, California.","summary_zh":"Intuitive Surgical, Inc. 開發、製造和銷售產品，使醫生和醫療保健提供者能夠提高美國和國際上微創護理的品質和獲得微創護理的機會。它提供達文西手術系統，可以使用微創方法進行外科手術；離子腔內系統，將其商業產品從外科手術擴展到診斷性腔內手術，從而實現肺部微創活檢。該公司還為其多端口達文西手術系統提供一套縫合、能源和核心儀器；支援其技術使用的漸進式學習途徑；客戶服務和支援專家的基礎設施，為客戶提供的一系列服務，包括安裝、維修、維護、24/7 技術支援和主動系統健康監控；整合的數位功能提供連網產品，透過增強計畫的洞察力醫院的績效。它透過直接銷售組織（例如資本和臨床銷售團隊）銷售其產品。 Intuitive Surgical, Inc. 成立於 1995 年，總部位於加州桑尼維爾。","sector_zh":"衛生保健","industry_zh":"醫療器材及用品","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-15","o":449.29,"h":450.58,"l":433.02,"c":433.99,"v":3474800},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":433.65,"h":437.17,"l":429.72,"c":434.5,"v":2940500},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":434.6,"h":438.79,"l":430.59,"c":433.66,"v":1638200},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":435.0,"h":436.33,"l":429.8,"c":435.83,"v":1980600},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":439.46,"h":440.5,"l":434.74,"c":438.72,"v":3780700},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":438.12,"h":447.13,"l":433.81,"c":444.55,"v":2653100},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":444.75,"h":450.99,"l":443.17,"c":447.75,"v":2241500},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":450.94,"h":451.34,"l":443.55,"c":443.99,"v":2437200},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":440.39,"h":442.17,"l":433.43,"c":438.12,"v":3129000},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":441.43,"h":443.46,"l":438.5,"c":441.12,"v":1940500},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":442.06,"h":443.26,"l":437.77,"c":439.22,"v":3024400},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":439.0,"h":448.19,"l":438.0,"c":447.23,"v":2134200},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":447.0,"h":448.31,"l":430.34,"c":438.04,"v":2502300},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":437.12,"h":443.36,"l":433.0,"c":443.01,"v":1910800},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":443.85,"h":456.59,"l":443.49,"c":452.35,"v":2197700},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":459.71,"h":460.3,"l":449.08,"c":449.69,"v":2478900},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":449.24,"h":451.0,"l":439.47,"c":440.94,"v":1917500},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":442.31,"h":450.53,"l":439.42,"c":448.09,"v":1767300},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":447.76,"h":450.29,"l":443.26,"c":443.76,"v":1583800},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":444.06,"h":446.99,"l":429.25,"c":429.59,"v":27734